  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening ethical standards of artificial intelligence and neurotechnologies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the vision of establishing and strengthening Ethical standards, norms and frameworks, UNESCO will implement activities which focus on strengthening the capacities to adopt ethics standards of AI and frontier technologies and to address inequalities, discrimination and to address other down risks of these technologies.  This activity will focus on promoting the implementation of the Recommendation on the Ethics of Artificial Intelligence and the raising awareness about the ethical concerns related to neurotechnologies.</narrative>
